          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are You Feeling a Hunger to Connect with Your Higher Self?",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_QdxhVB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Do you want to get in touch with your intuitive gifts and open your psychic ability?<br/><br/>Our alchemy retreat is specifically designed to deliver lost and ancient, higher dimensional wisdom of the universe. The transformation that it brings is deeper initiation of the mystics’ descending and ascending bodies in their energy field. Harmonizing these energies is absolutely vital to activating your Higher Self. <br/><br/>This 4-day emersion into spiritual alchemy will teach esoteric knowledge that is no longer in the public domain. It will highlight the role of our energy field in unlocking one’s own intuitive abilities. <br/><br/>Join us as we learn about the opportunities and pitfalls present during the ascension process into the 5th dimension and embody your Higher Self.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
