    "columns_1_8f4peA": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "text_FtAPaL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Join us in Sedona, Arizona as we open up your heart space, expand your consciousness, and deepen your spiritual awakening. This 4 Day/ 5 Night retreat is facilitated by experts in alchemy, energy healing, and the esoteric arts. With spiritual workshops, alchemy masterclasses, and mystical ceremonies, you will unlock a higher level of consciousness. </p>"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_AKLKTz": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Arrivals",
            "text": "<p>Your alchemical journey begins as you arrive into the spiritual vortex-Sedona, Arizona. Our first night together will be a time of connection, and an opportunity to get to know each other around a drum <strong>circle.</strong></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Woman_back_sillhouette.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_GgAgn8": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Alchemy Masterclass",
            "text": "<p>“You can command nature only to the extent that you’re willing to obey her.”</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Meditating_monk_graphic.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>During this masterclass, we will cover the spiritual art and science of Alchemy. This is a full day of seminar that will cover many aspects of spiritual knowledge including the ascension mechanics, important esoteric terminology, The different layers of our energy field, and advanced spiritual knowledge that supports the attendee's journey at this critical time…</p><p>This Masterclass is filled with ageless wisdom teachings and mystery school knowledge on various topics that are all related to spiritual awakening. It brings an inner clarity to subjects that were once too obscure or foreign to fully understand. One of the topics that will be covered is how cosmic consciousness structures our reality, which gives us the ability to leverage this wisdom toward our own creative evolution, manifestations and spiritual sovereignty. </p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_6bkXF7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Alchemize Through Shadow Work & Satsang",
            "text": "<p>“Know thyself, and you shall know the Universe and the Gods.”</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Eye_seeing_galaxy.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Shadow work is making conscious what is unconscious within the individual. </p><p>It is the practice of becoming aware of the overarching themes in our life, psychic and emotional wounds, triggers, invisible needs, archetypal equivalents, buried trauma, disempowering attitudes and patterns. The ascension process is the elevation of our subtle bodies onto a higher level of consciousness, or version of reality. This includes shifting our whole being into a different phase of consciousness. This process includes all of our bodies: the physical, emotional, mental, etheric and spiritual. </p><p>The reason shadow work is vital to the ascension process is because there’s no lasting transformation or transcendence when a being is unaware of themselves. Let us guide you through this journey.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_bJxqiP": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Connect With Your Higher Self in the Quantum Field",
            "text": "<p>Discover how to access the Quantum Field, meet your Higher Self, and activate your quantum heart portal through guided meditation.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cathedral_Rock_Sedona_under_stars.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>In this workshop, Susan Hassen will teach you how to access the Quantum Field to meet your Higher Self and how to work with quantum energy to use it for healing and strengthening your connection with your Higher Self. This workshop will cover how to alter your brainwave states to access the Quantum Field, along with a guided meditation into the Quantum. Participants will be transformed by activating their quantum heart portal and accessing new techniques that will allow them to interact with higher dimensional energy at all times.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_e8UAUk": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Open your Heart Center with Cacao",
            "text": "<p>Cacao is used in sacred medicinal rituals, where intentions are set and once consumed, euphoric states are unlocked, and we are able to connect to ourselves at a deeper level.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cacao_beans_cocao_crystals.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Cacao ceremonies have dated back for thousands of years, originating all the way back to Mayan traditions in Central and South America, used for spiritual, medicinal and ceremonial purposes for inner awakening and spiritual guidance. Pure cacao is used as a heart opening medicine for people to safely experience awakening, insight and inner healing, which is what we will facilitate during our <strong>ceremony.</strong></p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_mfkYLR": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Sound Bath",
            "text": "<p>Immerse in quartz crystal bowl sound healing to relax, restore, and align chakras—nourishing body, mind, and spirit.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Sound_bath_with_gongs2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This is an unforgettable sound experience for those who seek deep relaxation, rejuvenation, and introspection. You will be resting comfortably while a sequence of quartz crystal singing bowls are played.</p><p>Each bowl is keyed to the energy centers or chakras of the body, where sound is nutrition for the nervous system. The results are waves of peace, heightened awareness, and relaxation of the mind and body.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": false,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_EiG6Tg": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Departures",
            "text": "<p>You will be integrating this retreat for the coming weeks and processing the teachings, revelations and wisdom gained through this experience.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Grand_Canyon_Sedona_under_the_stars2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": false,
            "background_color": "#d5d9df",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
