    "05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Are Interested in Spiritual Alchemy",
            "text": "<p>Spiritual Alchemy transmutes core wounds, core beliefs, soul loss, and other self-destructive personality structures in order for you to live freely and unobstructed. Existing in “pure being,” or soulful awareness, is the ultimate state of transformation – the gold – of spiritual alchemy. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Want to Deepen Their Spirituality Awakening",
            "text": "<p>This retreat is an opportunity for you to strengthen and build on your current spiritual journey, and teach you the next steps to <strong>ascension.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Are Open-Minded",
            "text": "<p>This retreat is going to cover topics that may be considered fringe spirituality to some. If you are someone who is comfortable with deep diving into heavy, spiritual and alchemical teachings, and you’re jumping into spirituality without fear, this is the retreat for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_g9gexC": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Are Looking for the Next Step in their Spiritual Journey",
            "text": "<p>You’ve watched every single YouTube video on spiritual awakenings, and you’ve read all the books. Now what? If you find yourself longing to deepen your spirituality beyond the superficial stuff available on the internet, then this retreat is definitely for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-5": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Do you cater for Vegetarians or Vegans?",
            "text": "<p>The high end hotels and restaurants we will be visiting serve a variety of Egyptian and Western dishes with plenty of vegetarian options and some vegan options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-7": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What service can I expect when traveling with Mohamed Ibrahim?",
            "text": "<p>Mohamed Ibrahim and his company Saba Tours was established 15 years ago and is a member of the Egyptian Travel Agents Association (E.T.A.A)  the International Air Transport Association (IATA). You can expect a professional team with a high level of experience in the field of tourism and touring.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
