    "a9222eb4-8d59-40cd-9ce4-bad54c0c56ad": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Sarah_Elkhaldy_picture2.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Your Retreat Facilitators",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3>Sarah Elkhaldy</h3><p>MYSTIC & SPIRITUAL TEACHER</p><p>Sarah is a mystic and spiritual teacher. She is widely known as a leader in the field of Spirituality and the Esoteric Arts. Sarah is highly claircognizant. She uses her intuitive abilities as well as her extensive background in mysticism to help humanity activate our evolutionary potential. She is adept in bridging the higher worlds with the lower worlds, the outer world with the inner world. Her higher dimensional wisdom is channeled into teachings that emit frequencies designed to activate people on a soul level and awaken them to an ancient recognition of themselves and the nature of reality. </p><p>With an online community consisting of hundreds of thousands of awakening souls, it is her highest honor to assist humanity’s evolution.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "3",
        "show_wave": false,
