    "text_and_image_tKAw8k": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Susan_Hassen_picture.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "Featured Workshop Leader",
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Susan Hassen</strong></h3><p>ENERGY HEALER</p><p>Susan Hassen is a quantum and shamanic practitioner specializing in higher-dimensional healing. Susan is one the most sought after and renowned energy healers in the world (this is no joke, you can muscle test it). </p><p>With over ten years of experience working in the quantum field, Susan teaches master classes on accessing the quantum for self-healing, connecting with the Higher Self, and the evolution of consciousness. She is also a published author and spiritual teacher who is known for guiding her following through energetic activations and spiritual awakenings. </p><p>Susan will host a rare and powerful workshop on the Quantum Field and how to meet your Higher Self in the Quantum Field. </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "3",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_JPgmwm": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ash_Bio.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Learn From Incredible Experts",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Essence of Ash</strong></h3><p>Ash is an Archaeologist, Völva (a female practitioner of magic divination and prophecy), Artist, and Facilitator of Northern Sorcery. The old magic traditions of Scandinavia, and the wisdom of the wilderness are her sources of inspiration. <br/><br/>Her journey with the runes began over eleven years ago as a way to deepen connection to Norwegian roots. Ash’s teachings revolve around daily practice, ceremony, and nurturing relationships with Norse gods and goddesses. <br/><br/>She provides mentorship, divination, hand-poke tattoos, and crafted ritual tools. Her work is grounded in respect, integrity and awe for the primal power of the runes.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
