      }
    },
    "5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc3": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>The alchemy retreat was the highlight of my year. It was so valuable to be able to spend close up time with Sarah and meet other like minded individuals.</p>",
            "author": "Christina Willis",
            "author_info": "Zurich, Switzerland"
          }
        },
        "7dce2a2f-2ef5-43fc-b9a1-f0bcc76544c9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I am infinitely grateful for being part of The Alchemy Retreat in Sedona led by Sarah Elkhaldy, and Susan Hassen. </p><p>In this 4-day retreat I learned, remembered, healed, and activated parts of myself all surrounded by the magical energy of the desert in Sedona.</p><p>Sarah, The Alchemist, teaches profound and high vibrational concepts for those in search of soul and consciousness expansion, while Susan, Quantum Sphere Healer, offers a beautiful and exclusive workshop to connect with our Higher Self through a mediative journey involving gamma brainwave states. </p><p>I am forever in gratitude for such profound life changing experience at The Alchemy Retreat.</p>",
            "author": "Irma Feliza",
            "author_info": "London Ontario, Canada"
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Sarah's Alchemy Retreat sparked significant life transformations that have taken me to depths of healing and growth that I never thought possible. I have endless gratitude for the space she holds at her retreats. It was truly an unforgettable experience.</p>",
            "author": "Tim Corey",
            "author_info": "California, USA"
          }
        }
      },
