    "testimonials_mxFUkg": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_Tp39Hm": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "testimonial": "<p>This retreat is an opportunity for you to strengthen and build on your current spiritual journey, and teach you the next steps to <strong>ascension.</strong></p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_info": "Want to Deepen Their Spirituality Awakening"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_EM7yCE": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "testimonial": "<p>Spiritual Alchemy transmutes core wounds, core beliefs, soul loss, and other self-destructive personality structures in order for you to live freely and unobstructed. Existing in “pure being,” or soulful awareness, is the ultimate state of transformation – the gold – of spiritual alchemy. It attempts to restructure your personality and the various levels of attachment, avoidance, and identification you possess. This retreat is for people who want that.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_info": "Interested in Spiritual Alchemy"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_wiqAJP": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "testimonial": "<p>This retreat is going to cover topics that may be considered fringe spirituality to some. If you are someone who is comfortable with deep diving into heavy, spiritual and alchemical teachings, and you’re jumping into spirituality without fear, this is the retreat for you.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_info": "Are Open-Minded"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_c94xyt": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "testimonial": "<p>You’ve watched every single YouTube video on spiritual awakenings, and you’ve read all the books. Now what? If you find yourself longing to deepen your spirituality beyond the superficial stuff available on the internet, then this retreat is definitely for you.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_info": "Are Looking for the Next Step in their Spiritual Journey"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_DqJhbc": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.</p>",
            "author": "Author's name",
            "author_info": "Los Angeles, CA"
          }
        }
      },
