        "57393d7c-eaea-43e6-934b-e35643791451": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 1: Arrival - Tuesday, April 22nd",
            "text": "<ul><li>Arrival Day - Check In + Room Assignments + Welcome Ceremony allowing you to get to know the staff and other hand-selected attendees.<br/></li></ul>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Fjordtell.5f3e570f9869d350b4d723bf_IMG-4191.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46f98c92-e505-4141-a9a0-fa35c3e1337c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 2: Viking Valley + Onboarding - Wednesday, April 23rd",
            "text": "<p>Get to know your surroundings and enjoy a historical walk-through of the famous Viking Village. Viking History Panel: We will be learning more about the truths and myths of the Viking culture and history from our experts. We will also be laying a foundation of \"initiation\" - what it means and why rites of passage are so important.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01674.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "af9886df-0842-456c-a4da-f86a8fae9128": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 3: Excursion #1 - Thursday, April 24th",
            "text": "<p>We will take an excursion on a beautiful fjord cruise that will take us to the most beautiful train ride in the world! During this excursion the host will be working with select individuals for a group coaching conversation called \"Hot Seats\" which is optional for your involvement. We will also go on a few short but breathtaking hikes.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/AdobeStock_303296726.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "665f407f-c58f-4cfe-8e14-b0c7e48b8013": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 4: Viking Activities - Friday, April 26th",
            "text": "<p>Viking activities held in the Viking Village that allow you to enjoy and learn what it was like to be a Viking. From Black Smithing to cooking and axe throwing to bow and arrow. Get ready for some fun!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_DSC01416.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "a0ac19a9-eb3f-4293-b194-c7a3b463e4f6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 5: More Viking Activities - Saturday, April 27th",
            "text": "<p>Learn how to fight like a Viking. Our experts will teach about the ways Vikings would fight, learn about the authentic weaponry and tactics for becoming an elite Warrior.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01442_31547123-16df-45ac-9bbe-b5652473d808.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "356bfe06-89e2-457a-a782-ada1263e0d36": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 6: Men's & Women's Circles - Sunday, April 28th",
            "text": "<p>We split the attendees up into their respective feminine and masculine circles for deeper conversations, learnings and expansion. Each group gets to partake in an Epic team building activity and excursion, Rowing a real Viking Ship in the fjord of Norway with your own captain guiding you.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/56b9cef10cccd239095fa412_Daiva_Cikockaite_-_59.18.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "66db8b2b-fdc9-4434-bd63-38c72353b779": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 7: Excursion #2 - Monday, April 29th",
            "text": "<p>Surprise and bonus day! Deep excursions into secret caves and meditations and much, much more.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01491_2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dd20cdd8-6dc0-42a2-91c4-c110a0716601": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 8: Departure Day - Tuesday, April 30th",
            "text": "<p>Flexible for traveling</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/AdobeStock_238159159.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
